{"id":"d32337b1b5d5d337","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-axiom-decidable.md","title":"Axiom Set Decidable","display":"lem-axiom-decidable — Axiom Set Decidable","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-axiom-decidable","aliases":["92-lem-axiom-decidable"],"display":"lem-axiom-decidable — Axiom Set Decidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-axiom-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-axiom-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-axiom-decidable — Axiom Set Decidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (axiom set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}\\)</span> (elementary-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (Gödel codes of axioms)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\bigr)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\bigr)\\)</span> : 公理的Gödel码集可判定</li>\n<li>初等系统的定义提供一个递归特征函数，故其公理码集可判定</li>\n<li>系统G的公理：\n<ul>\n<li>逻辑公理：有限模板可判定</li>\n<li>PA公理：有限模板+归纳模式可判定</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>这是初等性的一个必要后果而非充分条件；初等性还要求规则实例关系可判定</li>\n<li>对具体<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>应用该条件式之前，还需由逻辑公理、有限PA公理、归纳模式及规则的有效检查证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span></li>\n<li>若还要声称“原始递归”，必须另行加强初等性定义中的复杂度界</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$ (axiom set of $G$, see [[92-df-axiom-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Elem}$ (elementary-system predicate, see [[92-df-elementary-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dec}$ (decidable-set predicate, see [[92-df-decidable-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}\\bigl(\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G))\\bigr)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false}],"bytes":1750,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-axiom-decidable]]"}],"outgoing":["35c764f4e9f21f28","b090f61b9f3ec664","e0eabee5d77258a7","360e00ddf38f0f16","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6"]}